rtunities below. Search Job Listings Main Campus Poughkeepsie, NY Florence Campus Florence, Italy Search Job Listings by School School of Communication and The Arts Full-Time Faculty Openings School of Computer Science and Mathematics Full-Time Faculty Openings School of Liberal Arts Full-Time Faculty Openings School of Management Full-Time Faculty Openings School of Science Full-Time Faculty Openings School of Social & Behavioral Sciences Full-Time Faculty Openings Career Quick Links Human Resources Benefits at Marist Institutional Policies Learn More About Marist Academics Diversity Hudson Valley Life Quick Links About Marist University Human Resources Community at Marist Benefits Employee Wellness Directions to Campus Image of a grey background with the Marist script M pattern. Welcome to Marist University, Like No Other A message from President Kevin Weinman Welcome to Marist, a remarkable success story over the past 95 years, transforming from a small regional college into a nationally and internationally renowned leader in higher education. We occupy a unique place amongst colleges and universities nationwide, providing students with all the resources and opportunities of a large university with the personalized attention and care expected of a small college. I often refer to us as being right in the \"sweet spot\" and it's why Marist is able to deliver a residential learning experience where students really thrive. Whether you study or work here, there's a strong sense of energy as Marist grows in stature and appeal, attracting a diverse and talented community. I invite you to explore what makes Marist so special and learn about the students, faculty, and staff who make Marist and its stunning campuses in New York and Florence truly remarkable. About President Weinman Image of Dr. Tarantello Inspired to Open Minds and Open Doors Dr. Tarantello believes the power of mentorship builds lifelong skills—and confidence. An English literature professor inspired by her own Marist education, Patty believes in the power of curiosity and personal connections. Just as her professors did, she encourages students to think critically, embrace new ideas, and find joy in unexpected discoveries. For Patty, every lesson is a chance to open a new door of possibility. Watch Dr. Tarantello's Story Be Inspired Marist 100: Improving the World Through Education Marist 100 is an ambitious strategic plan that seeks to position Marist for a major leap forward. It's built upon our unique strengths and designed to carry us through and beyond our upcoming centennial in 2029. The plan will help make a Marist education accessible to a broader range of talented students. The plan has three pillars: Academic Vibrancy Student Centrality Expansive Community Read more about why Marist is on the rise Image of the Marist University campus in Poughkeepsie, New York. The Heart of the Hudson River Valley Learn more about life in the Hudson River Valley > TIME World's Greatest Places TOP 100 Poughkeepsie Named Top 100 Cities “The ‘Queen City of the Hudson’ has all the magnetism that would tempt a big-city cash-out: a peaceful, safe downtown, college town spirit, and historic architecture.” TOP 23 Best Places to Go in the U.S. Workplace Notices Know Your Rights New York Paid Sick Leave New York Equal Pay Provisions New York Paid Family Leave Pregnant Workers Fairness Act Asset Publisher Featured News Marist's Own Minecraft Server Levels Up Campus Community Powered by Marist's computing infrastructure, MaristMC gives students a new digital space to connect, compete, and create. Read More Dr. Carol Rinke Named ACE Fellow, Joining Select National Leadership Cohort Marist University Assistant Provost for Student Success has been selected for the highly selective program, a premier leadership development opportunity in higher education. Read More Between 2 Foxes : Talking AI and Pickleball A candid sit-down with Marist’s most recent Distinguished Teaching Award winner talking about AI and her passion for teaching and pickleball—and then it's game on for a lesson you don't want to miss! Read More View More Hidden Close footer Join the Conversation Instagram Facebook LinkedIn TikTok YouTube Twitter Academics Experiental Learning Majors, Minors, and Programs Study Abroad Athletics Clubs and Activities Dining Residence Life Quick Links Directory Visit Campus Maps & Directions Careers at Marist Support Marist Marist 100 - Strategic Plan Website Feedback Newsroom Virtual Tour To view an accessible version of our virtual tour, click here. Marist University, 3399 North Road, Poughkeepsie, NY 12601 | 845-575-3000 © Copyright 2026 \n                    Marist University. All Rights Reserved. Disclaimers | Privacy Policy | Accessibility Policy | Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information For screen reader problems with this website, please email helpdesk@marist.edu Close"
