t is $100 Adult students enrolled in the Florence Bachelor's Degree program deposit is $750 To make your online payment, you will need your Campus Wide ID Number. This information was provided to you in your acceptance packet on the tuition deposit form. Deposits will be credited in your first semester's tuition bill. Please remember to print your receipt of payment for your records. Written confirmation from the Admission office, along with an enrollment packet, will be mailed to you within a few weeks. Hidden Close footer Join the Conversation Instagram Facebook LinkedIn TikTok YouTube Twitter Academics Experiental Learning Majors, Minors, and Programs Study Abroad Athletics Clubs and Activities Dining Residence Life Quick Links Directory Visit Campus Maps & Directions Careers at Marist Support Marist Marist 100 - Strategic Plan Website Feedback Newsroom Virtual Tour To view an accessible version of our virtual tour, click here. Marist University, 3399 North Road, Poughkeepsie, NY 12601 | 845-575-3000 © Copyright 2026 \n                    Marist University. All Rights Reserved. Disclaimers | Privacy Policy | Accessibility Policy | Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information For screen reader problems with this website, please email helpdesk@marist.edu Close"
