      "description": "Careers at Marist - Marist University Skip to Main Content About Marist University Summer Preview Days Get a firsthand look at life at Marist University during our Summer Preview Days! These events are designed to help you explore campus, connect with our community, and better understand the admissions process. Summer Preview Days will be held July 13 , July 29 , August 14 , and August 17 . Learn More and Register About About Marist Quick Facts Locations Campus Map Office of Community and Belonging Leadership <em>Marist 100</em> Strategic Plan Explore the Hudson River Valley History & Heritage Accreditation Financial Statements Campus Offices Admissions & Financial Aid Counseling Services Events Services First Year Experience Housing & Residential Life Human Resources President's Office Campus Safety Title IX Connect with Us Schedule a Visit Careers at Marist Give to Marist Events Calendar Host Events at Marist News Subscribe to Inside Marist Directory Related Links Science and Health Initiative University Announcement Bookstore Commencement Academic Calendar President's Report Lecture Series Marist Italy Sustainability Dean's List Related Links Science and Health Initiative University Announcement Bookstore Commencement Academic Calendar President's Report Lecture Series Marist Italy Sustainability Dean's List About Marist Quick Facts Locations Campus Map Office of Community and Belonging Leadership <em>Marist 100</em> Strategic Plan Explore the Hudson River Valley History & Heritage Accreditation Financial Statements Campus Offices Admissions & Financial Aid Counseling Services Events Services First Year Experience Housing & Residential Life Human Resources President's Office Campus Safety Title IX Connect with Us Schedule a Visit Careers at Marist Give to Marist Events Calendar Host Events at Marist News Subscribe to Inside Marist Directory Academics Marist University Summer Preview Days Get a firsthand look at life at Marist University duri